# An `after`-only rule ([LTAC]): the rule arms a `$Timer` and its follow-up,
# re-activated by each pump's `$ClockTick`, fires once its guard
# `fire_at <= now` holds. Synthetic facts are `$`-led ([LLEX.10.6.1]) and not
# DS-visible, so neither runtime reports them. 301_s clears the 5_min
# deferral.
assert Trig v=1
pump
advance 301000000000
pump
